col←readMapColumn(vector column_type row_count);data;list_col;ns;kvpairs;i
⍝ Read a MAP column from a DuckDB vector
⍝ vector: the DuckDB vector pointer
⍝ column_type: the logical type of the column
⍝ row_count: number of rows
⍝ Returns: vector of namespaces with 'keys' and 'values' fields

⎕io←0

⍝ Maps in DuckDB are stored as LISTs of STRUCTs with 'key' and 'value' fields
⍝ So we can use readListColumn to get the list of key-value pairs
⍝ Then extract keys and values from each struct

data←api.duckdb_vector_get_data vector
list_col←readListColumn vector data row_count

⍝ Extract keys and values from key-value structs (one namespace per row)
col←row_count⍴⊂⎕NS''
:For i :In ⍳row_count
    kvpairs←i⊃list_col
    ns←⎕NS''
    :If 0=≢kvpairs
        ns ⎕VSET('keys' ⍬)('values' ⍬)
    :Else
        :If 9=⎕NC'kvpairs.key'
            kvpairs←,⊂kvpairs
        :EndIf
        ns ⎕VSET('keys'(kvpairs ⎕VGET'key'))('values'(kvpairs ⎕VGET'value'))
    :EndIf
    col[i]←⊂ns
:EndFor

⍝ KSL 2.0.0
